--- create meta-mine:recipes-app/widget/widget_1.2.bb
SUMMARY = "A widget"
LICENSE = "MIT"
LIC_FILES_CHKSUM = "file://LICENSE;md5=0835ade698e0bcf8506ecda2f7b4f302"

SRC_URI = "git://github.com/example/widget.git;protocol=https;branch=main;destsuffix=${BP}"
SRCREV = "89abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef"
note: the git source unpacks into ${BP} (destsuffix=${BP}), so the default S works on every release from kirkstone to wrynose; from whinlatter that is the git fetcher's default and the parameter can be dropped
note: build `none`: no class is inherited; add do_compile / do_install as needed
